1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:14,939
[Host] Welcome to Japanese Daily News. I'm Maya. Today is June tenth. The soccer World Cup kicks off tomorrow in North America — and this one is the biggest in history. Let's listen.

2
00:00:15,539 --> 00:00:18,300
[News] 今日のニュースです。

3
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:26,271
[News] サッカーのワールドカップが、あす、6月11日に始まります。

4
00:00:26,972 --> 00:00:34,676
[News] 今度の大会は、アメリカとカナダとメキシコの3つの国で行われます。

5
00:00:35,375 --> 00:00:41,856
[News] 3つの国が一緒にワールドカップを開くのは、初めてです。

6
00:00:42,555 --> 00:00:49,875
[News] 出るチームの数は、今までの32から48に増えました。

7
00:00:50,576 --> 00:00:56,024
[News] 歴史の中で、一番大きい大会になります。

8
00:00:56,723 --> 00:01:03,875
[News] 最初の試合は、メキシコの首都、メキシコシティで行われます。

9
00:01:04,575 --> 00:01:12,760
[News] 日本は、グループFで、オランダ、チュニジア、スウェーデンと試合をします。

10
00:01:13,459 --> 00:01:24,091
[News] 日本の最初の試合は、オランダとの試合で、日本時間の6月15日の朝5時に始まります。

11
00:01:24,792 --> 00:01:29,951
[News] 大会は、7月19日まで続きます。

12
00:01:30,652 --> 00:01:36,292
[News] 世界中の人たちが、とても楽しみにしています。

13
00:01:36,992 --> 00:01:38,623
[Host] Let's break it down.

14
00:01:39,224 --> 00:01:48,031
[Slow] 今度の大会は、アメリカとカナダとメキシコの3つの国で行われます。

15
00:01:48,831 --> 00:01:55,287
[Host] This tournament will be held in three countries: the United States, Canada, and Mexico.

16
00:01:55,888 --> 00:01:58,215
[Vocab] 大会

17
00:01:58,615 --> 00:02:06,560
[Host] It means a tournament, or a big event. Marathons, sports days, the Olympics — they all use this word.

18
00:02:07,159 --> 00:02:14,575
[Slow] 3つの国が一緒にワールドカップを開くのは、初めてです。

19
00:02:15,376 --> 00:02:19,575
[Host] It's the first time three countries are hosting the World Cup together.

20
00:02:20,175 --> 00:02:22,431
[Vocab] 一緒に

21
00:02:22,831 --> 00:02:29,768
[Host] It means together. You'll use it constantly — eating together, going somewhere together, working together.

22
00:02:30,367 --> 00:02:38,743
[Slow] 出るチームの数は、今までの32から48に増えました。

23
00:02:39,544 --> 00:02:43,936
[Host] The number of teams taking part has grown from thirty-two to forty-eight.

24
00:02:44,536 --> 00:02:46,719
[Vocab] 増える

25
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:55,256
[Host] It means to increase, to go up in number. News stories use it all the time for prices, visitors, and populations.

26
00:02:55,855 --> 00:03:02,072
[Slow] 歴史の中で、一番大きい大会になります。

27
00:03:02,872 --> 00:03:05,608
[Host] It will be the biggest tournament in history.

28
00:03:06,207 --> 00:03:08,536
[Vocab] 歴史

29
00:03:08,936 --> 00:03:15,295
[Host] It means history. You'll meet it in museums, textbooks, and any sentence about the past.

30
00:03:15,895 --> 00:03:24,080
[Slow] 最初の試合は、メキシコの首都、メキシコシティで行われます。

31
00:03:24,879 --> 00:03:29,943
[Host] The opening match will be held in Mexico City, the capital of Mexico.

32
00:03:30,544 --> 00:03:32,560
[Vocab] 首都

33
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:38,527
[Host] It means a capital city — the main city of a country, like Tokyo for Japan.

34
00:03:39,127 --> 00:03:48,487
[Slow] 日本は、グループFで、オランダ、チュニジア、スウェーデンと試合をします。

35
00:03:49,288 --> 00:03:54,831
[Host] Japan is in Group F and will play the Netherlands, Tunisia, and Sweden.

36
00:03:55,431 --> 00:03:57,663
[Vocab] 試合

37
00:03:58,063 --> 00:04:04,592
[Host] It means a match or a game. Any sports contest, from soccer to judo, is one of these.

38
00:04:05,192 --> 00:04:17,336
[Slow] 日本の最初の試合は、オランダとの試合で、日本時間の6月15日の朝5時に始まります。

39
00:04:18,136 --> 00:04:25,432
[Host] Japan's first match is against the Netherlands, starting at five in the morning on June fifteenth, Japan time.

40
00:04:26,031 --> 00:04:28,336
[Vocab] 最初

41
00:04:28,735 --> 00:04:34,064
[Host] It means the first, or the very beginning. Its opposite means the last.

42
00:04:34,663 --> 00:04:40,543
[Slow] 大会は、7月19日まで続きます。

43
00:04:41,343 --> 00:04:44,704
[Host] The tournament continues until July nineteenth.

44
00:04:45,303 --> 00:04:47,560
[Vocab] 続く

45
00:04:47,959 --> 00:04:54,608
[Host] It means to continue, to go on. Weather forecasts love it — rain that continues all week.

46
00:04:55,208 --> 00:04:58,208
[Host] Let's listen to the full story one more time.

47
00:04:58,807 --> 00:05:01,567
[News] 今日のニュースです。

48
00:05:02,267 --> 00:05:09,540
[News] サッカーのワールドカップが、あす、6月11日に始まります。

49
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:17,944
[News] 今度の大会は、アメリカとカナダとメキシコの3つの国で行われます。

